From 420ee6c0bca735eece1d623aa7bfe25445c82771 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johann Glock <johann.glock@scch.at>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 10:38:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(annotate): settle abandoned JSON sessions without gate
 mode

Annotation-only CLI callers remained blocked after the review tab closed
because client leases required approval mode. Enable the existing
disconnect lease for local direct JSON annotation while preserving hook,
plaintext, remote, and sharing exclusions.

The focused 94-test run passes. A built CLI and real browser preserve a
brief reconnect, then emit dismissed and release the listener after the
final tab closes.
